(f) A person or entity in possession of a valid permit issued pursuant to the Public Conduct Ordinance of Glynn County, so long as such person is in compliance with the requirements of that Chapter and the terms of the permit and safety plan, and any person engaged in the activity related to such permitted organization or individual.
(Ord. No. O-2023-07, § I, 6/1/2023)
